<title>USA: CIPSCO Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>CIPSCO Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ill. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p>Quarter ended December 31:</p>
<p> Operating Revenues (000)	 $227,783		 $203,993</p>
<p> Net Income (000)		     11,539		    4,830</p>
<p> Average Shares (000)		 34,070		   34,070</p>
<p> Earnings per Average Share	   .34*		     .14*</p>
<p>* 1996 and 1995 results include unusual charges equivalent</p>
<p>to $0.02 and $0.24 cents per share, respectively.</p>
<p>12 months ended December 31:</p>
<p> Operating Revenues (000)	  896,715		  842,262</p>
<p> Net Income (000)		     80,057		   72,015</p>
<p> Average Shares (000)		 34,070		   34,070</p>
<p> Earnings per Average Share	 2.35**		   2.11**</p>
<p>** 1996 and 1995 results include unusual charges</p>
<p>equivalent to $0.15 cents and $0.34 cents per share,</p>
<p>respectively.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
